      "writtenOn": "2025-01-10T17:22:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "hmm. It\u0027s not really related to the coherency of the walker though, is it?\n\nWe should probably use `IOMMU_CACHE` unconditionally and let the stage-1 override it, like we do for the CPU. What do you think?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1580,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 1580,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "d33221fe83a96619bf1f9c4e3da6668286312463",
