        "id": 1572468
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-01-13T15:01:49Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e the upstream driver does assume that coherent_walk implies the master is coherent also.\n\nDoes it? I don\u0027t think it does -- `IOMMU_CACHE` should be driven by the `dma-coherent` property on the device.",
      "parentUuid": "ee663323_65e22776",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1580,
        "startChar": 43,
        "endLine": 1580,
        "endChar": 56
      },
      "revId": "d33221fe83a96619bf1f9c4e3da6668286312463",
